28.07

Added "log out from all devices" endpoint

++ POST /auth/logout-all
   - requires "Authorization: Bearer <authToken>" header (missing/invalid => 401)
   - no request body
   - revokes every auth token of the calling account, including the caller's own device
   - the account is not deleted; email + OTP login still works afterwards
   - returns BasicResponse: {"message": string, "success": boolean}



